---
title: "9 · Opportunity files"
description: Where the drafts, signed copies and other files of a deal are kept.
sidebar:
  order: 10
  label: "9 · Opportunity files"
---

**Who:** anyone who can see the opportunity can see its files. Uploading needs edit rights on the opportunity.

Each opportunity is treated as a case with its own folder. The drafts (PDF and Word), the edited drafts, the signed copies and every file uploaded on the **Files** tab are kept there.

{% screenshot id="crm/files-tab" caption="The Files tab of an opportunity." /%}

While the folder holds files, the same folder is also shown in the document library under **Cases**, next to the folders of task cases.

{% screenshot id="crm/files-library-cases" caption="The same folder under Cases in the document library." /%}
